{"3389720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DETECTIVE - Rainy night", "steam_appid": 3389720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>🕵️‍♀️The detective has done their part. Now it’s the forensic team’s turn.🧪</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/0e62aaaff52776141f361be0a50ff4de.avif?t=1779953035\" width=1536 height=496 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FORENSIC – M.E. Protocol</strong> shifts the focus of investigation games, moving away from dialogue-based deduction toward hands-on <strong>crime scene analysis</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t just question suspects, you’ll examine the environment and collect every piece of evidence needed to reconstruct what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/58c13d579498d89346c910580b53767e.avif?t=1779953035\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the <strong>nine cases</strong> presents a different scenario, ranging from violent confrontations to incidents that appear to be accidents. Nothing is explained in advance. You arrive at the scene, study the details, and determine the truth for yourself.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/dbb7d9ee6e6c2ce29182ef45ab40dfac.avif?t=1779953035\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no time limits to pressure you and no predetermined solutions. In FORENSIC – M.E. Protocol, you take the time to catalogue evidence, review clues, and carefully piece together the sequence of events.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Add Forensic M.E. Protocol to your Steam Wishlist!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/0e62aaaff52776141f361be0a50ff4de.avif?t=1779953035\" width=1536 height=496 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detective Rainy Night places you in the shoes of Iker Carmona, a police officer tasked with investigating strange disappearances in the area. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After driving all day, Iker decides to spend the night at a motel called “Holiday.” </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/f93ae62b1fbb438e3e2bc1bea29f36d6.poster.avif?t=1779953035\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/f93ae62b1fbb438e3e2bc1bea29f36d6.webm?t=1779953035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/f93ae62b1fbb438e3e2bc1bea29f36d6.mp4?t=1779953035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next morning, he hears an argument outside his room. Upon stepping out, he discovers there is no electricity, mobile phones and computers aren’t working, vehicles won’t start, and it has begun to rain heavily. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/3ac65603022bf010a7d5e12669538d26.poster.avif?t=1779953035\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/3ac65603022bf010a7d5e12669538d26.webm?t=1779953035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/3ac65603022bf010a7d5e12669538d26.mp4?t=1779953035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven guests are staying at the motel alongside you, each with their own story. As the weather worsens and vehicles remain unusable, no one can leave the motel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over five days divided into 12 narrative-driven levels, you will experience unexplained phenomena, disappearances, deaths, and cryptic symbols—all unfolding within the motel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/a1fd8c29fa8e11e2bd8bd434fc40892f.poster.avif?t=1779953035\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/a1fd8c29fa8e11e2bd8bd434fc40892f.webm?t=1779953035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/a1fd8c29fa8e11e2bd8bd434fc40892f.mp4?t=1779953035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a police detective, your role will involve speaking to guests, interrogating them, and piecing together the truth behind these events. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detective Rainy Night is a guided narrative adventure with elements of deduction. Throughout the game, events will unfold that you’ll need to recall later to solve the case. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/b8fa9e074453db99a25dd79030fc944a.poster.avif?t=1779953035\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/b8fa9e074453db99a25dd79030fc944a.webm?t=1779953035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/b8fa9e074453db99a25dd79030fc944a.mp4?t=1779953035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Violent crimes, mature stories, and psychological terror await you in the Motel Holiday. Grab a pen and paper because cracking this case won’t be easy. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detective Rainy Night places you in the shoes of Iker Carmona, a police officer tasked with investigating strange disappearances in the area. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After driving all day, Iker decides to spend the night at a motel called “Holiday.” </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/f93ae62b1fbb438e3e2bc1bea29f36d6.poster.avif?t=1779953035\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/f93ae62b1fbb438e3e2bc1bea29f36d6.webm?t=1779953035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/f93ae62b1fbb438e3e2bc1bea29f36d6.mp4?t=1779953035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next morning, he hears an argument outside his room. Upon stepping out, he discovers there is no electricity, mobile phones and computers aren’t working, vehicles won’t start, and it has begun to rain heavily. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/3ac65603022bf010a7d5e12669538d26.poster.avif?t=1779953035\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https: