4a.poster.avif?t=1779953035\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/b8fa9e074453db99a25dd79030fc944a.webm?t=1779953035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/extras/b8fa9e074453db99a25dd79030fc944a.mp4?t=1779953035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Violent crimes, mature stories, and psychological terror await you in the Motel Holiday. Grab a pen and paper because cracking this case won’t be easy. </p>", "short_description": "Detective Rainy Night is a narrative adventure with elements of deduction. Violent crimes, mature stories, and a touch of psychological horror await you at the Motel Holiday. Grab a pencil and paper because solving this case won’t be easy. ", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/header.jpg?t=1779953035", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/a97082584bf88e474e106a23e442abf4f129db97/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779953035", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389720/a97082584bf88e474e106a23e442abf4f129db97/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779953035", "website": "https://www.jandusoft.com/detectiverainynight/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit or Mac OS X 10.9.2 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD processor, 2.5 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 470 GTX or AMD Radeon 6870 HD series card or 